      "value": "@{64f8e8d313b550392ac6b63b|full_name}\n\nAssuming my Canny proposal gets adopted, it would be even better if hiding ADs could be included as a VRC+ perk.\n\nbut...... if possible, I'd prefer it to be optional.\n\nI'm more than happy to tolerate loading screen ads for the sake of this community",
